  "stageId": null,
  "title": "射擊訓練",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a7790612fec9d62d9fbfa915439d8073d1b4e227c9cf90d3d5c619aafbb8102f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三點鐘20M，術師目標A。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "八點鐘30M，重裝防禦人員身後的指揮者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "注意十點鐘有敵方狙擊人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "05：32 PM   天氣/晴\n龍門接舷區，羅德島艦船，底層射擊訓練室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "這才第五組折返射擊而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "最後的目標轉換速度明顯慢了下來，而且也沒有命中有效擊殺點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "如果是實戰的話說不定已經反過來被敵人擊中了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "怎麼了，潔西卡，是不是這些訓練對你來說還是太勉強了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "哈，哈哈，呼......並，並不會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "請指導我繼續練習！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "氣勢還不錯，不過強撐可不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我們稍微休息10分鐘，儘快將自己的氣息調整好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "在這10分鐘裡，我會再跟你強調一次手持銃械的基礎運用準則。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "即使是在戰場，也一刻都不能忘記這些最核心的部分！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "首先永遠保證姿態的穩定和平衡，不管在怎樣的地形中移動，身體核心都不能放鬆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "上身保持壓低，保證重心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "其次，控制銃械運作的源石技藝絕對不能有半點紊亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "從手臂連接到銃械內部，精確地感知彈藥的推送情況，然後啟動銃芯開火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "說起來輕鬆，但是需要細膩地進行源石技藝的持續觸發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "一旦出現了技藝紊亂，就很可能造成射擊失誤甚至銃械的損壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "最後則是對目標的瞄準射擊和再次移動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "在黑鋼的射擊理論中，這些僅僅是基礎中的基礎，潔西卡你也應該了然於胸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "那麼，你知道你剛才的射擊中最大的問題在哪裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "呃......是因為我的練習量不夠，所以重心不穩轉換的速度不快，然後源石技藝控制不精....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "以及......開槍的時候總是要嘛猶豫要嘛鬆懈，總不能命中目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "啊啊啊，這麼一想我這不是每一個部分都有很大的問題嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "你說得一半對，一半不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "潔西卡你總是想要兼顧一切，既想要做到速度夠快，還要命中率夠高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "在不知不覺期間，你會在各個環節都畏首畏尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "因為你的急迫，導致你的源石技藝控制最先出現混亂。因此，當你應當開始瞄準敵人時，你卻還要去進行銃械內部的控制檢驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "從這裡開始，你的射擊就會出現問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "原、原來是這樣的...！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "首先你要做的是丟掉那些你太在意的各個方面，先專注於指尖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "相信你的搭檔，手中的槍不會欺騙你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "你如何對待它，它就會如何回應你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "源石技藝輸送的量和速度不是關鍵，謹記，精度控制和穩定性才是最重要的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "來吧，繼續。連續移動到三個練習台對前方多個目標進行快速射擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "再進行五組！專注於手上的源石技藝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "基本訓練、基本訓練、基本訓練，已經是第三個小時了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我可以離開這個充滿汗味的訓練室了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "只是潔西卡的一個切城廢墟的偵查任務而已，至於看重到連休息日都消耗進去嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "難不成還會剛好偶遇出來閒逛的大惡人不成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我覺得潔西卡需要訓練訓練自己的自信心才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "看看這些黑鋼的資料，潔西卡的各項資料都屬於中等水準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "作為特派羅德島的正式員工之一，潔西卡自然也有不小的壓力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "雖然是和霜葉隕星她們一起的偵察任務，做好準備總不會有壞處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "累垮了在戰場上沒力氣了怎麼辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "她擔心自己成為他人的累贅，想要提高自己的作戰能力，所以才來專門找了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "龍門的清掃任務結束後，我們還得回一趟黑鋼本部，沒有那麼多時間可以陪潔西卡做訓練了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "關於手持銃械的使用，我儘量也想把我更多的經驗分享給她，能多一點也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "為了可愛的晚輩，真不錯啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我還以為你已經忘記了我們還得回黑鋼一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "這一趟回去不僅要上報龍門任務的情況，還得進行例行的檢驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "你就完全不準備一下？不怕這次的考核評價降低了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我早就準備好需要上報的資料了，我又不是回到羅德島以後只在睡覺和閒逛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "嘿~你怎麼知道我回來只睡覺和閒逛了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "雷蛇前輩真是個關照同事的人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "至於考核，如果評價降了要調走的話，我是不是就不用跟你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "看你陪潔西卡的這些練習，我猜充其量也只是一些加大訓練量，累積經驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "比起在這裡一遍一遍一遍的原地苦練——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "既然是使用銃械的研討會，為什麼不去找那些亮閃閃的天使們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "她們才是真正的銃械宗師吧。砰~嗙！潔西卡能從她們那裡學個一招半式，怎麼也比從你這裡學的強多了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "問他們的話，無非就是“這有什麼難的，就跟走路一樣簡單啊？”“全憑感覺不就可以做到了？”那麼幾句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "對使用起複數大型銃械都得心應手的天使們來說，這種輕型銃械簡直就如同小孩子的玩具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "拉特蘭的銃械使用術過於先進和複雜。從中可得不到什麼參考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "嘿，那可真是讓人羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我們要掌握在瞬息萬變的場合下的精細源石技藝控制，那可不是一般量的訓練就能達到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "為什麼創建黑鋼的老闆們，非要讓下面的人使用這種費力不討好的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "同樣是遠程作戰，比起手弩操作難度高不說，彈藥還貴，保養還麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "黑鋼選擇手槍不是沒有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "制式武器對公司來說降低了管理難度和人員變動的風險，篩選了庸才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "在作戰中不僅能保證了射速和效率，也確實比其他的遠程武器易於攜帶和隱藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "好了好了好了我可不想再聽你說這些了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我算是清楚了，你們繼續你們的， 沒事的話我就回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我會在心中為潔西卡加油打氣的，在回黑鋼總部之前，我需要更多的休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我特意叫你來不是隨便說說的，潔西卡也需要你的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我可沒辦法教她在戰場前線一邊進攻還能一邊高速作戰的訣竅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "你教她帶上一塊大盾牌一邊放電一邊移動不行嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "別耍嘴皮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "比起我的建議，你的經驗肯定更能夠幫助到潔西卡才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "在作戰前線來回移動，輕鬆突破敵人防禦，還能長時間維持源石技藝強化武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "在黑鋼之中還有誰能在源石技藝的控制上比得過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "停停停，為什麼你老是能自然的說出來這些話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我聽著都要臉紅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "呼，要教教潔西卡也不是不行。但是我並不知道怎麼樣做個老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "如果理解不了我說的，跟不上我的節奏的話，我可不會慢慢地手把手教。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "那當然，潔西卡也是這麼希望的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "......你剛才給我的這份潔西卡考核資料，你有看過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "怎麼，我還沒有看過。資料真的很糟糕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "潔西卡明明那麼努力了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "你仔細看看這些，木頭腦袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "雖然潔西卡沒有任何一項資料在黑鋼內能排進前列，但是比起綜合資料來說，潔西卡可一點不比我們差多少啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "不管潔西卡自己多沒有自信，這可不是一個差生的資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "長久的訓練和堅持，可絕對不會辜負付出努力的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "這......我一點都沒有發現這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "你啊，別把木頭腦袋也教給了潔西卡就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
